      "q": "How much does Atlantic Diving Supply make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Atlantic Diving Supply obligated $3.8B from federal contracts in FY2026 to date. Atlantic Diving Supply won 55,860 awards in that period, and the average award size was $67.7K. Atlantic Diving Supply obligations are down 36.9% year over year compared with prior fiscal periods."
